    "description": {
      "value": "**Trigger:** A foe reduces you to half your Hit Points or fewer.\n\nYou feel the most alive when pushed into a corner, as the insights and vision granted by the flame stoke into overdrive. Your body begins to emit a blazing aura of flames. You gain greater darkvision, low-light vision, and the ability to see invisible creatures. You gain a fly Speed equal to your land Speed as you launch flame from your aura to soar through the sky. You become quickened, and you can use the extra action each round only to Strike or Fly using your flames. Any creature who starts their turn within 5 feet of you takes 1d12 fire damage."
